# Gaurav Singh

> Personal website of Gaurav Singh, a researcher working at the intersection of design, machine learning, and engineering. Originally from India and now based in Varsity Lakes, Australia, he was a faculty member at Srishti Manipal Institute from 2017 to 2022.

All pages are plain HTML at the URLs below. The full text of the notes and
yearly reflections is available in one file at {{ site.url }}/llms-full.txt.

